                                "sense_id": "be1be31c-2049-3705-8955-8a2b3667fab1",
                                "text": "Where OOCSS and SMACSS can be seen as a more of frameworks for thinking about structured CSS combined with some handy rules of thumb, BEM is a much more rigid system for how to author and name your styles. BEM is originally an application development methodology from the search engine company Yandex."
